# demo-video fake-agent cassette — OpenCode boot screen, present-only (Issue #2380)
#
# One 200-row frame, replayed with --idle-only in an 80x200 pane
# (OPENCODE_PANE_WIDTH / OPENCODE_PANE_HEIGHT — wider panes paint a sidebar
# into every captured row, #2047). fake-agent.sh --tool opencode sizes the pane.
#
# Provenance: real `tmux capture-pane -p -e` of opencode 1.18.22 at 80x200,
# taken on 2026-08-28 for Issue #2049 —
# tests/fixtures/opencode-live-2049/boot-idle-11822.txt — with the three
# footer rows that carried the capture directory rewritten to the demo seed. The
# `┃  Ask anything...` composer row and the `tab agents  ctrl+p commands`
# footer are the detector's anchors; do not strip the ANSI or drop the blank
# rows, the composer's row position is part of the capture.
